OL,3,ATwo teenagers, 13 and 14, among 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-three people from the UK,
OL,7,Fincluding a 13-year-old girl and
OL,8,F14-year-old boy, are among hundreds
OL,9,Ffeared missing following a deadly flash
OL,10,Fflood near the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,12,FAt least 165 people have died after
OL,13,Fflooding and mudslides on Wednesday,
OL,14,FNepal's National Disaster Risk
OL,15,FReduction and Management Authority
OL,16,F(NDRRMA) has said.
OL,18,FIt added that 826 people are missing,
OL,19,Fwith the number of missing tourists
OL,20,Fsaid to be more than 529.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
